   Current order (index.html): Translate / Practice (Flashcards, Recall Mode) /
   Pronunciation (Pinyin Chart, Pinyin Guide) / Grammar (Guide, Flashcards) /
   Courses (14-Day) / Simplified-Traditional (Guide, Cheat Sheet, Flashcards).
